<title>GERMANY: FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table gives data on expectations of growth and industry trends for the six months from October 1996, issued by the ZEW Zentrum fuer Europaeische Wirtschaftsforschung GmbH research institute.</p>
<p>The percentage figures are compiled from a survey of 303 firms conducted from October 7-22. Figures in brackets show the change from September's survey.</p>
<p>ECONOMY - ASSESSMENT OF THE GENERAL ECONOMIC SITUATION</p>
<p>				Good	  Normal	  Bad</p>
<p>Germany		 0.0  (-0.7)   43.5(+11.2)   56.5(-10.5)</p>
<p>U.S.		   76.8  (-0.1)   22.9 (+0.1)    0.3(+-0.0)</p>
<p>Japan		   1.7  (+0.6)   38.1 (-0.4)   60.2 (-0.2)</p>
<p>Britain		26.3  (+8.6)   68.9 (-7.2)    4.8 (-1.4)</p>
<p>France		  0.4  (+0.1)   37.0 (+7.0)   62.6 (-7.1)</p>
<p>Italy		   1.8 (+-0.0)   59.9 (-3.8)   38.3 (+3.8)</p>
<p>ECONOMY - EXPECTATIONS FOR THE NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			    Improve	 No change     Worsen</p>
<p>Germany		78.5  (+4.9)   19.2 (-4.6)    2.3 (-0.3)</p>
<p>U.S.		    8.1  (-1.3)   79.7 (+1.8)   12.2 (-0.5)</p>
<p>Japan		  63.9  (-5.6)   34.0 (+4.5)    2.1 (+1.1)</p>
<p>Britain		20.2  (+3.6)   76.3 (-2.9)    3.5 (-0.7)</p>
<p>France		 59.3  (+2.3)   37.2 (-1.3)    3.5 (-1.0)</p>
<p>Italy		  35.6  (+7.8)   56.9 (-9.3)    7.5 (+1.5)</p>
<p>INDUSTRY SECTORS - PROFIT EXPECTATIONS FOR NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			    Improve	 No change     Worsen</p>
<p>Banks		   33.3 (-1.7)   57.3(+-0.0)    9.4 (+1.7)</p>
<p>Insurance	     27.8 (-4.3)   62.7 (+2.8)    9.5 (+1.5)</p>
<p>Automotives	   79.3 (+6.2)   18.6 (-4.8)    2.1 (-1.4)</p>
<p>Chemicals	     76.0 (+2.7)   20.8 (-5.2)    3.2 (+2.5)</p>
<p>Steel		   45.4 (+9.3)   46.4 (-7.5)    8.2 (-1.8)</p>
<p>Electronics	   62.3 (+5.2)   34.5 (-4.9)    3.2 (-0.3)</p>
<p>Engineering	   66.3 (+6.8)   28.0 (-6.5)    5.7 (-0.3)</p>
<p>Consumer goods	22.4 (+3.3)   64.1 (+1.2)   13.5 (-4.5)</p>
<p>Trade		   19.2 (+6.4)   63.8 (-5.0)   17.0 (-1.4)</p>
<p>Construction	   5.2 (-4.0)   42.5 (+7.8)   52.3 (-3.8)</p>
